This repository vendors the PyTorch Contact-GraspNet port as a git submodule at
third_party/contact_graspnet_pytorch.

Upstream:
  https://github.com/elchun/contact_graspnet_pytorch

The submodule is read-only in this project. The ROS wrapper uses only:
  - contact_graspnet_pytorch.contact_graspnet.ContactGraspnet
  - checkpoints/contact_graspnet/checkpoints/model.pt

The wrapper's core/geometry.py is a typed, headless adaptation of pure NumPy
helpers from the upstream port (depth-to-point-cloud, regularization, farthest
point selection, filtering and 6-DoF grasp construction). It is covered by the
upstream license.

The upstream repository includes License.pdf. Review it before redistributing
the model weights or a container image that contains them.
